WEBVTT

Connect a project
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.799
Create a review project in the admin workspace.

00:00:04.799 --> 00:00:09.600
Enter the site URL and select Save.

Share an invitation
00:00:09.600 --> 00:00:14.400
Copy the invitation link and send it to your team.

Install the bookmark
00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:20.555
Open the invitation and press Ctrl + Shift + B
to show the bookmarks bar.

00:00:20.555 --> 00:00:25.357
Drag the Geomsupin button with the project name
to the bookmarks bar.

00:00:25.357 --> 00:00:30.279
Open the review site in a new tab,
then click the saved bookmark.

Pin and comment
00:00:30.279 --> 00:00:35.079
Select Leave a request and click where
you want to leave feedback.

00:00:35.079 --> 00:00:42.966
Enter a display name and your feedback, then select Submit.
A screenshot is saved with the request.

Replies and status
00:00:42.966 --> 00:00:47.890
The admin can see the same pin and screenshot
on the Requests tab.

00:00:47.890 --> 00:00:52.690
The assignee replies and marks the request as Resolved.

00:00:52.690 --> 00:00:57.489
The reply and status update appear
in the reviewer’s original tab.

00:00:57.489 --> 00:01:03.490
Click the bookmark again after opening another page
or refreshing the tab.
